# RGJ-B3-003 / RGJ-B3-006 — PlatformPlayer integration specification
#
# This patch specification is intentionally semantic rather than a blind full
# replacement of upstream PlatformPlayer. Upstream carries MIDP plus Nokia,
# Siemens, KDDI, DoJa and JBlend listener/control compatibility and must remain
# the public facade.
#
# Add target backend field:
#   private RG35XXNativePlayer rg35xxPlayer;
#
# Constructor policy for RG35XX/libretro target:
#   MIDI/tone -> RG35XXNativePlayer; tone remains conversion-to-MIDI before
#                registration where existing FreeJ2ME semantics require it.
#   WAV       -> RG35XXWavDecoder first, then setPcm16(decoded PCM/rate/channels).
#   unsupported advertised types -> do not route to desktop JavaSound/MP3.
#   generic/non-RG35XX target -> preserve upstream PlatformPlayer behavior.
#
# Lifecycle delegation on RG35XX target:
#   realize()      -> rg35xxPlayer.realize()
#   prefetch()     -> rg35xxPlayer.prefetch()
#   start()        -> rg35xxPlayer.start(), then existing listener notifications
#   stop()         -> rg35xxPlayer.stop(), then existing listener notifications
#   setMediaTime() -> rg35xxPlayer.setMediaTime()
#   setLoopCount() -> rg35xxPlayer.setLoopCount()
#   close()        -> rg35xxPlayer.close(), then existing CLOSED notifications
#
# VolumeControl:
#   setLevel(level) must call rg35xxPlayer.setVolume(level) on target backend.
#   Mute remains Java semantic state but maps effective native volume to zero;
#   unmute restores the previous requested level.
#
# END_OF_MEDIA:
#   Do NOT synthesize END_OF_MEDIA from Java timers for native-backed media.
#   Native playback remains authoritative and sends the proven completion event
#   back to Java. That event updates PlatformPlayer state/listeners exactly once.
#
# RELEASE / game change:
#   close every registered player before RG35XXAudioBootstrap.shutdown().
#   shutdown sends RESET as final defensive native-cache cleanup.
#
# Rollback:
#   Keep the existing SD command/media bridge until this backend and native mixer
#   have passed consolidated static/protocol audit. Do not delete the old bridge
#   in this task.
